summary:
  Any cutting writer that ends gives its station to the single file until the widget is restarted.

history:
  A writer ends with its stream now, so an outage of half a minute ends
  one on a station that cuts perfectly well. Marked as one that cannot be cut,
  the station would keep the single file for the session after the first lid
  closed. Only a writer that ended in its first minute is taken for that.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
                  if (SlideLogic.endedYoung(runMs)) _slideDead[streamUrl] = true;

replace:
                  _slideDead[streamUrl] = true;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_slideengine.qml::test_a_cutting_writer_that_ends_after_a_minute_is_replaced_by_one_that_slides_again.
